{
  "id": "cisco-ios",
  "name": "Cisco IOS / IOS-XE",
  "description": "Switches e roteadores Cisco IOS/IOS-XE. Desliga paginação e entra no modo enable se houver senha.",
  "default_port": 22,
  "pty": true,
  "sftp": "none",
  "init_commands": [
    "terminal length 0",
    "terminal width 0"
  ],
  "enable_support": true,
  "legacy_hint": true,
  "quick_commands": [
    {
      "group": "Sistema",
      "label": "Versão",
      "command": "show version"
    },
    {
      "group": "Sistema",
      "label": "Inventário",
      "command": "show inventory"
    },
    {
      "group": "Sistema",
      "label": "Relógio e usuários",
      "command": "show clock; show users"
    },
    {
      "group": "Configuração",
      "label": "Running-config",
      "command": "show running-config"
    },
    {
      "group": "Configuração",
      "label": "Startup-config",
      "command": "show startup-config"
    },
    {
      "group": "Configuração",
      "label": "Salvar (write memory)",
      "command": "write memory",
      "dangerous": true
    },
    {
      "group": "Interfaces",
      "label": "Resumo de interfaces IP",
      "command": "show ip interface brief"
    },
    {
      "group": "Interfaces",
      "label": "Status das portas",
      "command": "show interfaces status"
    },
    {
      "group": "Interfaces",
      "label": "Erros nas interfaces",
      "command": "show interfaces counters errors"
    },
    {
      "group": "L2",
      "label": "VLANs",
      "command": "show vlan brief"
    },
    {
      "group": "L2",
      "label": "Tabela MAC",
      "command": "show mac address-table"
    },
    {
      "group": "L2",
      "label": "Spanning-tree",
      "command": "show spanning-tree summary"
    },
    {
      "group": "L2",
      "label": "EtherChannel",
      "command": "show etherchannel summary"
    },
    {
      "group": "L2",
      "label": "Vizinhos CDP",
      "command": "show cdp neighbors detail"
    },
    {
      "group": "L2",
      "label": "Vizinhos LLDP",
      "command": "show lldp neighbors"
    },
    {
      "group": "L3",
      "label": "Rotas IP",
      "command": "show ip route"
    },
    {
      "group": "L3",
      "label": "Vizinhos OSPF",
      "command": "show ip ospf neighbor"
    },
    {
      "group": "L3",
      "label": "Resumo BGP",
      "command": "show ip bgp summary"
    },
    {
      "group": "Logs",
      "label": "Log do equipamento",
      "command": "show logging"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Se o equipamento tiver senha de enable, informe-a no cadastro do host; o TT envia `enable` e a senha após o login.",
    "IOS antigo pode exigir algoritmos legados (diffie-hellman-group1-sha1, aes-cbc, ssh-rsa). Ative a opção 'Algoritmos legados' no host, ciente de que são menos seguros."
  ],
  "readonly": [
    "show"
  ],
  "allow_pipe": true
}
